" begin="02:04.140" end="02:07.830"><span begin="02:04.140" end="02:04.710">Please </span><span begin="02:04.710" end="02:05.130">tell </span><span begin="02:05.130" end="02:05.640">mom </span><span begin="02:05.640" end="02:05.880">this </span><span begin="02:05.880" end="02:06.060">is </span><span begin="02:06.060" end="02:06.450">not </span><span begin="02:06.450" end="02:06.840">her </span><span begin="02:06.840" end="02:07.830">fault</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.660" end="02:24.930"><span begin="02:21.660" end="02:21.900">I </span><span begin="02:21.900" end="02:22.560">never </span><span begin="02:22.560" end="02:23.670">conquered </span><span begin="02:23.670" end="02:24.300">rarely </span><span begin="02:24.300" end="02:24.930">came</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.920" end="02:32.190"><span begin="02:28.920" end="02:29.430">Days </span><span begin="02:29.430" end="02:29.700">when </span><span begin="02:29.700" end="02:30.120">i </span><span begin="02:30.120" end="02:30.660">still </span><span begin="02:30.660" end="02:31.260">felt </span><span begin="02:31.260" end="02:32.190">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.220" end="02:35.520"><span begin="02:32.220" end="02:32.430">We </span><span begin="02:32.430" end="02:33.090">couldn't </span><span begin="02:33.090" end="02:33.780">wait </span><span begin="02:33.780" end="02:33.930">to </span><span begin="02:33.930" end="02:34.470">get </span><span begin="02:34.470" end="02:35.520">outside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.520" end="02:39.150"><span begin="02:35.520" end="02:35.640">The </span><span begin="02:35.640" end="02:36.360">world </span><span begin="02:36.360" end="02:36.570">was </span><span begin="02:36.570" end="02:37.200">wide </span><span begin="02:37.200" end="02:37.440">too </span><span begin="02:37.440" end="02:38.100">late </span><span begin="02:38.100" end="02:38.280">to </span><span begin="02:38.280" end="02:39.150">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="0